---
import DocLayout from "../../layouts/DocLayout.astro";
---

<DocLayout
  title="Home Manager & Nix"
  eyebrow="SECTION 04 / NIXOS"
  description="Let the module own the service, stable environment, incoming-agent registration, and SSH client setting."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <div class="warning note">
      <strong>PLANNED FOR v0.1</strong>The flake package and app are available
      today; the Home Manager module shown here is not yet exported from main.
    </div>
    <h2>
      Flake input
    </h2><pre><code>inputs.lanyard.url = "github:jwilger/lanyard-ssh-agent";</code></pre>
    <h2>
      Home Manager module
    </h2><pre><code>{`{ inputs, ... }: {
  imports = [ inputs.lanyard.homeManagerModules.default ];

  programs.lanyard-ssh-agent = {
    enable = true;
    staticAgents = [ "$HOME/.1password/agent.sock" ];
  };
}`}</code></pre>
    <p>
      The module installs a systemd user service, configures the stable socket,
      and provides shell integration that registers an incoming forwarded socket <em
        >before</em
      > replacing <code>SSH_AUTH_SOCK</code>.
    </p>
    <h2>
      Manual SSH configuration
    </h2><pre><code>programs.ssh.matchBlocks."*".identityAgent =
  "$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/lanyard-ssh-agent/agent.sock";</code></pre>
    <div class="warning note">
      <strong>ORDER MATTERS</strong>If your shell overwrites <code
        >SSH_AUTH_SOCK</code
      > first, the temporary forwarded path is lost. Capture, register, then export.
    </div>
  </div>
</DocLayout>
